    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling team-based third-person shooter where cooperation is key. Work together to complete challenging missions, face powerful enemies, and uncover hidden secrets in a dynamic battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449750/extras/99f5ded9b68ed2c4130b72fdfad770eb.avif?t=1745901556\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Red One is a game about capturing the &quot;Red One&quot;. Fight powerful monsters in dangerous battlefields to obtain the &quot;Red One&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449750/extras/c6f8476ebd37452e2af24adc6da47a6a.avif?t=1745901556\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then escape the battlefield while avoiding threatening players hiding everywhere. You must successfully escape to obtain the goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449750/extras/9d15c3bb3037469f821f95edd620d09e.avif?t=1745901556\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your guard down because PVP and PVE are happening at the same time. You can either win everything or lose everything.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling team-based third-person shooter where cooperation is key. Work together to complete challenging missions, face powerful enemies, and uncover hidden secrets in a dynamic battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449750/extras/99f5ded9b68ed2c4130b72fdfad770eb.avif?t=1745901556\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Red One is a game about capturing the &quot;Red One&quot;. Fight powerful monsters in dangerous battlefields to obtain the &quot;Red One&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449750/extras/c6f8476ebd37452e2af24adc6da47a6a.avif?t=1745901556\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then escape the battlefield while avoiding threatening players hiding everywhere. You must successfully escape to obtain the goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449750/extras/9d15c3bb3037469f821f95edd620d09e.avif?t=1745901556\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your guard down because PVP and PVE are happening at the same time. You can either win everything or lose everything.</p>",
